<title>ERP Integration for Mercado Libre</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>ERP Integration for Mercado Libre</h1>
<p>
This application connects a company's ERP system with Mercado Libre.
It publishes and updates product listings, receives sales orders from
the seller account, and sends them to the ERP for management and
invoicing.
</p>
<p>
It is an internal integration that runs on the company's local server.
It uses OAuth 2.0 with read and write permissions and offline access
to refresh tokens automatically.
</p>
</body>
</html>
